The Penguin project is a soft-fork of Pelican (https://pelican.dev), which in
turn builds on the Pterodactyl ecosystem. This provider targets the Penguin /
Pelican Application API and keeps compatibility with the Pterodactyl-lineage
egg ecosystem.

Provider design was informed by prior open-source Terraform providers in the
Pterodactyl ecosystem, notably Luiggi33/terraform-provider-pterodactyl (MIT).
No source code from those projects is incorporated into this repository; this
notice records that their public API-client patterns were referenced.
